# Project Manager Git Ignore

# Option 1: If you want to commit the database (recommended for small teams)
# Uncomment the line below to ignore exports only
# exports/

# Option 2: If you prefer to export and commit JSON/YAML instead of the db
# Uncomment the line below to ignore the database
# project.db

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.bak
*~

# Python cache (if running pm_cli.py directly)
__pycache__/
*.pyc
